# The new app (the lysterfield-lake-next Worker, wrangler.jsonc), built with
# `vite build --mode next` by `deploy-next`. Its videos come from the
# lysterfield-lake-next-dreams R2 bucket, through its custom domain (cached
# at Cloudflare's edge; the bucket's r2.dev URL is rate-limited and
# uncached, so it's only for testing).
VITE_APP_DREAMS=https://next-dreams.lysterfieldlake.com
VITE_APP_URL=https://lysterfield-lake-next.superhighfives.workers.dev
